{"id":"n13968-1-9","stage":2,"title":"시야 · 视野","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13968-1-9-1","ko":"눈이 나빠서 앞이 잘 안 보여요.","zh":"我的视力不好，看不清楚前面的东西。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈이","meaning":"视力，眼神","explanation":"눈：视力，眼神；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"2","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈이","audio":"/audio/6f2474549eb981a98228.mp3"}},{"text":"나빠서","meaning":"不合适，不适于","explanation":"나쁘다：不合适，不适于；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"5","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나빠서","audio":"/audio/3e9f99a46629c8a90d71.mp3"}},{"text":"앞이","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞이","audio":"/audio/c74b78ad5b87526d4712.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"보여요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfac