"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13968","senseId":"1","lemma":"시야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시야가","audio":"/audio/b002249c09c1ec0b0467.mp3"}},{"text":"밝아질","meaning":"亮，天亮；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"밝다：亮，天亮；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64746","senseId":"2","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밝아질","audio":"/audio/672bb75b81dc70e921b3.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7c40f615a28bcb4a","term":"안경","zh":"眼镜","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3","entryId":"31484","definition":"为了保护眼睛或矫正视力而戴在眼睛上的东西。","pronunciation":["안ː경"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"c30f56ae00dca78e","term":"시야","zh":"视野，视线","audio":"/audio/c30f56ae00dca78e3875.mp3","entryId":"13968","definition":"眼睛能看到的范围。","pronunciation":["시ː야"]},{"id":"e97bef4d1c5d4c2f","term":"밝다","zh":"亮，天亮","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3","entryId":"64746","definition":"夜晚过去，早晨来临。","pronunciation":["박따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","ent